      <div class="kpi-value">39.08 <span style="font-size:0.55em;font-weight:400">kWh</span></div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Total: 326,472 kWh delivered</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card warn">
      <div class="kpi-label">Mean Station Load</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">53.18 <span style="font-size:0.55em;font-weight:400">kW</span></div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Peak avg: 84.07 &middot; Max: 100.0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent">
      <div class="kpi-label">Renewable Energy Ratio</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">35.4<span style="font-size:0.55em;font-weight:400">%</span></div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Off-Peak: 39.3% &middot; Peak: 29.0%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card danger">
      <div class="kpi-label">Mean Optimization Reward</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">&minus;11.83</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Off-Peak: &minus;7.06 &middot; Peak: &minus;19.80</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- SECTION 1: Station Utilization & Demand Analysis             -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section" id="station-utilization">
    <h2><span class="sec-num">1</span> Station Utilization &amp; Demand Analysis</h2>
    <p class="sec-obj">Analyze charging demand distribution across stations and location types, identifying high-demand stations, peak utilization periods, and capacity constraints.</p>

    <div class="chart-grid">
      <div class="chart-box">
        <h4>Sessions by Location Type</h4>
        <canvas id="chartSessionsLoc"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-box">
        <h4>Sessions by Time Slot</h4>
        <canvas id="chartSessionsTime"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-grid">
      <div class="chart-box chart-full">
        <h4>Avg Charging Demand by Location Type &amp; Time Slot</h4>
        <canvas id="chartDemandLocTime"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-grid">
      <div class="chart-box chart-full">
        <h4>Demand Heatmap: Day of Week &times; Time Slot</h4>
        <canvas id="chartDemandDayTime"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;margin:18px 0 10px;font-weight:600;">Top 10 Busiest Stations</h3>
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Station</th><th>Location</th><th class="num">Sessions</th><th class="num">Avg Demand</th><th class="num">Avg Load (kW)</th><th class="num">Avg Queue</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>ST013</td><td>Highway</td><td class="num">459</td><td class="num">53.41</td><td class="num">53.60</td><td class="num">4.69</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST001</td><td>Highway</td><td class="num">443</td><td class="num">54.25</td><td class="num">54.51</td><td class="num">4.52</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST005</td><td>Urban</td><td class="num">438</td><td class="num">52.94</td><td class="num">52.92</td><td class="num">4.61</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST017</td><td>Highway</td><td class="num">434</td><td class="num">52.03</td><td class="num">52.06</td><td class="num">4.78</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST011</td><td>Urban</td><td class="num">432</td><td class="num">51.09</td><td class="num">51.14</td><td class="num">4.66</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST003</td><td>Urban</td><td class="num">431</td><td class="num">55.14</td><td class="num">54.92</td><td class="num">4.60</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST019</td><td>Highway</td><td class="num">427</td><td class="num">51.54</td><td class="num">51.60</td><td class="num">4.56</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST012</td><td>Urban</td><td class="num">421</td><td class="num">56.07</td><td class="num">55.85</td><td class="num">4.61</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST009</td><td>Highway</td><td class="num">417</td><td class="num">52.52</td><td class="num">52.53</td><td class="num">4.62</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ST015</td><td>Urban</td><td class="num">416</td><td class="num">52.94</td><td class="num">53.22</td><td class="num">4.47</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="takeaway">
      <strong>Key Takeaway</strong>
      The network splits almost evenly between Urban (4,188 sessions) and Highway (4,166) stations. Peak-period demand averages 84 vs. 35 during Off-Peak &mdash; a 2.4&times; differential. Session volume is concentrated in Off-Peak hours (62.5% of all sessions), but demand intensity is far greater during Peak. Day-of-week variation is minimal, suggesting demand is time-slot driven rather than calendar-driven.
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- SECTION 2: Queue Length & Waiting Time Analysis              -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section" id="queue-wait">
    <h2><span class="sec-num">2</span> Queue Length &amp; Waiting Time Analysis</h2>
    <p class="sec-obj">Examine queue lengths and waiting times by station, time slot, vehicle type, and traffic density to identify bottleneck patterns and quantify the customer experience impact.</p>

